#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:4
msgid "Adding a New Device Backend"
msgstr "添加新的设备后端"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:6
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to add a **new accelerator** to LMCache in "
"**Multiprocess (MP) mode**. Device vendors can choose either supported "
"ownership model:"
msgstr "本指南解释了如何在 **多进程 (MP) 模式** 下向 LMCache 添加一个 **新加速器**。设备供应商可以选择支持的所有权模型："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:10
msgid ""
"**In-tree integration:** contribute and maintain the backend under "
"``lmcache/v1/platform/<device>/`` in the LMCache repository. This fits "
"backends that should ship, test, and release with LMCache."
msgstr "**树内集成：** 在 LMCache 仓库的 ``lmcache/v1/platform/<device>/`` 下贡献和维护后端。这适用于需要与 LMCache 一起发布、测试和发布的后端。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:13
msgid ""
"**External wheel integration:** maintain the backend in a vendor "
"repository and publish a wheel through the ``lmcache.device_plugins`` "
"entry-point group. This fits backends that need an independent release "
"cadence or own native-package distribution."
msgstr "**外部轮子集成：** 在供应商库中维护后端，并通过 ``lmcache.device_plugins`` 入口点组发布轮子。这适合需要独立发布节奏或拥有本地包分发的后端。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:18
msgid ""
"Both models implement the same ``DeviceSpec`` and ``DeviceOps`` "
"interfaces and use the same runtime detection and dispatch paths."
msgstr "两个模型实现了相同的 ``DeviceSpec`` 和 ``DeviceOps`` 接口，并使用相同的运行时检测和调度路径。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:21
msgid ""
"**For basic users:** read :ref:`Part 1 <part-1-basic>` only — a "
"``DeviceSpec`` and a ``DeviceOps`` subclass are all you need to use the "
"built-in torch baseline ops."
msgstr "**对于基础用户：** 仅阅读 :ref:`Part 1 <part-1-basic>` — 一个 ``DeviceSpec`` 和一个 ``DeviceOps`` 子类就是使用内置的 torch 基线操作所需的一切。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:25
msgid ""
"**For advanced users:** continue to :ref:`Part 2 <part-2-performance>` "
"for native ops and advanced transfer modes."
msgstr "**对于高级用户：** 继续阅读 :ref:`Part 2 <part-2-performance>` 以了解原生操作和高级传输模式。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:31
msgid "Part 1 — Basic Function Enabling"
msgstr "第 1 部分 — 基本功能启用"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:33
msgid ""
"For the majority of devices, a ``DeviceSpec`` class plus a minimal "
"``DeviceOps`` subclass are sufficient.  LMCache ships with a complete "
"torch baseline ops layer (``lmcache/v1/platform/torch_ops.py``) that "
"works on any device supporting standard PyTorch tensor operations — **no "
"custom kernels required**."
msgstr "对于大多数设备，一个 ``DeviceSpec`` 类加上一个最小的 ``DeviceOps`` 子类就足够了。LMCache 附带一个完整的 PyTorch 基线操作层 (``lmcache/v1/platform/torch_ops.py``)，可以在支持标准 PyTorch 张量操作的任何设备上工作 — **无需自定义内核**。"

