msgstr "直接在 LMCache 中创建一个平台包::"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:71
msgid ""
"Define ``FooDeviceSpec`` in ``__init__.py``. LMCache scans its built-in "
"platform packages, so this option needs no entry point or registration "
"list. Submit the code, tests, and device documentation in an LMCache PR; "
"after merge, the backend follows the LMCache release lifecycle."
msgstr "在 ``__init__.py`` 中定义 ``FooDeviceSpec``。LMCache 会扫描其内置的平台包，因此此选项不需要入口点或注册列表。将代码、测试和设备文档提交到 LMCache 的 PR；合并后，后端将遵循 LMCache 的发布生命周期。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:77
msgid "Option B — maintain an external wheel"
msgstr "选项 B — 维护一个外部轮子"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:79
msgid "Use a ``src`` layout so the wheel owns only its vendor namespace::"
msgstr "使用 ``src`` 布局，使得 wheel 仅拥有其供应商命名空间::"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:89
msgid ""
"The project must declare one entry point in the "
"``lmcache.device_plugins`` group. Its name is the lowercase "
"``DeviceSpec.backend_name`` and its value points to the ``DeviceSpec`` "
"class:"
msgstr "项目必须在 ``lmcache.device_plugins`` 组中声明一个入口点。它的名称是小写的 ``DeviceSpec.backend_name``，其值指向 ``DeviceSpec`` 类："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:111
msgid ""
"Pin ``lmcache`` to the version range tested by your plugin before "
"publishing it. LMCache treats ``DeviceSpec`` and ``DeviceOps`` as the "
"plugin interface; incompatible interface changes should be caught by that"
" dependency range."
msgstr "在发布之前，将 ``lmcache`` 固定到您的插件经过测试的版本范围。LMCache 将 ``DeviceSpec`` 和 ``DeviceOps`` 视为插件接口；不兼容的接口更改应通过该依赖范围捕获。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:116
msgid "Step 2: Implement ``FooDeviceSpec``"
msgstr "步骤 2：实现 ``FooDeviceSpec``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:118
msgid "Create the spec in the location selected in Step 1:"
msgstr "在步骤 1 中选择的位置创建规范："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:120
msgid "In-tree: ``lmcache/v1/platform/foo/__init__.py``."
msgstr "树内: ``lmcache/v1/platform/foo/__init__.py``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:121
msgid "External wheel: ``src/lmcache_foo/device.py``."
msgstr "外部轮子: ``src/lmcache_foo/device.py``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:123
msgid "The implementation is the same in both layouts:"
msgstr "实现方式在这两种布局中是相同的："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:170
msgid ""
"For an external wheel, the entry-point target must be the class itself, "
"not a class instance or factory. For either model, the class must have a "
"no-argument constructor; LMCache instantiates it once per process and "
"caches it."
msgstr "对于外部 wheel，入口点目标必须是类本身，而不是类实例或工厂。对于任一模型，该类必须具有无参数构造函数；LMCache 每个进程实例化一次并进行缓存。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:175
msgid "Step 3: Implement ``FooDeviceOps``"
msgstr "步骤 3：实现 ``FooDeviceOps``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:177
msgid "Create ``device_ops.py`` next to the spec package:"
msgstr "在规范包旁边创建 ``device_ops.py``："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:179
msgid "In-tree: ``lmcache/v1/platform/foo/device_ops.py``."
msgstr "树内: ``lmcache/v1/platform/foo/device_ops.py``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:180
msgid "External wheel: ``src/lmcache_foo/device_ops.py``."
msgstr "外部轮子: ``src/lmcache_foo/device_ops.py``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:203
msgid ""
"If you have no native extension yet, leave ``ensure_native`` as a no-op. "
"The torch baseline handles everything. See :ref:`Part 2 "
"<part-2-performance>` when the backend also ships native code."
msgstr "如果您还没有本地扩展，请将 ``ensure_native`` 保持为无操作。torch 基线处理所有内容。当后端也提供本地代码时，请参见 :ref:`Part 2 <part-2-performance>`。"

