msgstr "返回此设备的 ``DeviceOps`` 子类。基础返回 ``DeviceOps`` 本身（纯 Torch 基线）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:229
msgid "``DeviceSpec.is_available()``"
msgstr "``DeviceSpec.is_available()``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:231
msgid "Returns ``True`` when the device is usable"
msgstr "当设备可用时返回 ``True``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:232
msgid "``DeviceOps.ensure_native()``"
msgstr "``DeviceOps.ensure_native()``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:234
msgid ""
"Called once on first use; override to bind native ops. Base is a no-op "
"(e.g. ``HpuDeviceOps`` inherits it unchanged)."
msgstr "首次使用时调用一次；重写以绑定本地操作。基础是无操作（例如 ``HpuDeviceOps`` 继承时保持不变）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:239
msgid ""
"The ``hasattr(torch, \"foo\")`` guard shown above is only needed for out-"
"of-tree PyTorch extensions (e.g. ``torch.musa``, ``torch.xpu`` when "
"installed as a plug-in).  For accelerators shipped inside PyTorch itself "
"(like ``torch.cuda``) a plain ``torch.foo.is_available()`` is enough."
msgstr ""
"上面显示的 ``hasattr(torch, \"foo\")`` 保护仅在使用树外 PyTorch 扩展时需要（例如，当作为插件安装的 "
"``torch.musa``、``torch.xpu``）。对于 PyTorch 本身提供的加速器（如 "
"``torch.cuda``），只需使用简单的 ``torch.foo.is_available()`` 即可。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:246
msgid "Step 4: Install the selected integration"
msgstr "步骤 4：安装选定的集成"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:248
msgid ""
"For an in-tree backend, build or install LMCache normally from the branch"
" containing the platform package. Once merged and released, users receive"
" the backend with LMCache itself."
msgstr "对于树内后端，通常从包含平台包的分支构建或安装 LMCache。一旦合并并发布，用户将与 LMCache 一起接收到后端。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:252
msgid ""
"For an external backend, build the vendor project with any PEP 517 "
"frontend, then install its wheel in the same Python environment as "
"LMCache and the serving engine:"
msgstr "对于外部后端，使用任何 PEP 517 前端构建供应商项目，然后在与 LMCache 和服务引擎相同的 Python 环境中安装其 wheel："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:262
msgid ""
"Restart every LMCache and serving-engine process after installing either "
"integration. The platform registry is built once and cached for the "
"lifetime of each process."
msgstr "安装任一集成后，重新启动每个 LMCache 和服务引擎进程。平台注册表仅构建一次，并在每个进程的生命周期内缓存。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:266
msgid ""
"Neither model requires editing a global device-name list. All ops route "
"through ``torch_ops.py`` until the backend overrides them."
msgstr "两个模型都不需要编辑全局设备名称列表。所有操作都通过 ``torch_ops.py`` 路由，直到后端覆盖它们。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:270
msgid "External wheel loading rules"
msgstr "外部轮子加载规则"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:272
msgid ""
"``DeviceSpec.device_type`` is the torch-facing device category (for "
"example, ``\"cuda\"``). Multiple backends may intentionally share one "
"``device_type``."
msgstr "``DeviceSpec.device_type`` 是面向 torch 的设备类别（例如，``\"cuda\"``）。多个后端可能故意共享一个 ``device_type``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:274
msgid ""
"``DeviceSpec.backend_name`` is the LMCache-specific selector for one "
"concrete backend implementation. It must be a unique, non-empty lowercase"
" string."
msgstr "``DeviceSpec.backend_name`` 是 LMCache 特定的选择器，用于指定一个具体的后端实现。它必须是一个唯一的、非空的小写字符串。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:276
msgid ""
"For external wheels, the entry-point name must match "
"``DeviceSpec.backend_name``."
msgstr "对于外部轮子，入口点名称必须与 ``DeviceSpec.backend_name`` 匹配。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:278
msgid ""
"Duplicate ``backend_name`` values are ignored after the first "
"deterministic match."
msgstr "重复的 ``backend_name`` 值在第一次确定性匹配后会被忽略。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:280
msgid ""
"A plugin that cannot be imported, resolves to the wrong object type, or "
"raises during construction is logged and skipped. Other devices remain "
"usable."
msgstr "无法导入的插件、解析为错误的对象类型或在构造过程中引发异常的插件将被记录并跳过。其他设备仍然可用。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:283
msgid ""
"Entry-point modules are imported while the platform registry initializes."
" Import base interfaces such as "
"``lmcache.v1.platform.base.device_spec.DeviceSpec`` directly and keep "
"ops, native libraries, IPC wrappers, and cache contexts behind lazy "
"properties."
msgstr "在平台注册初始化时，入口点模块会被导入。直接导入基础接口，例如 ``lmcache.v1.platform.base.device_spec.DeviceSpec``，并将操作、原生库、IPC 包装器和缓存上下文放在惰性属性后面。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:287
msgid ""
"Installed entry-point packages are executable Python code. Only install "
"wheels from sources you trust."
msgstr "已安装的入口点包是可执行的 Python 代码。仅从您信任的来源安装 wheel。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:291
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:293
msgid ""
"Start LMCache server.  The worker below uses the engine-driven transfer "
"path, which the server only loads when ``--supported-transfer-mode`` is "
"``engine_driven`` or ``auto`` (the default is ``lmcache_driven``):"
msgstr "启动 LMCache 服务器。下面的工作进程使用引擎驱动的传输路径，服务器仅在 ``--supported-transfer-mode`` 设置为 ``engine_driven`` 或 ``auto``（默认是 ``lmcache_driven``）时加载该路径："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:303
msgid ""
"Run vLLM with MP connector. If you want a specific torch device category,"
" set ``DEVICE_TYPE``. Backends that share one device type are selected "
"automatically when exactly one reports available. If multiple backends "
"report available, set ``LMCACHE_DEVICE_BACKEND`` to select the exact "
"implementation:"
msgstr "使用 MP 连接器运行 vLLM。如果您想要特定的 torch 设备类别，请设置 ``DEVICE_TYPE``。当恰好一个后端报告可用时，共享同一设备类型的后端会自动选择。如果多个后端报告可用，请设置 ``LMCACHE_DEVICE_BACKEND`` 以选择确切的实现："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:329
msgid ""
"The default transfer mode is ``auto`` (CUDA → LMCache-driven, other "
"devices → engine-driven).  The example above explicitly sets "
"``engine_driven`` so that a new non-CUDA device works without additional "
"capability checks.  For the ``lmcache_driven`` mode (IPC zero-copy), see "
":ref:`Advanced transfer mode <part-2-performance>`."
msgstr ""
"默认传输模式为 ``auto``（CUDA → LMCache 驱动，其他设备 → 引擎驱动）。上述示例明确设置为 "
"``engine_driven``，以便新的非 CUDA 设备在没有额外能力检查的情况下正常工作。有关 ``lmcache_driven`` "
"模式（IPC 零拷贝），请参见 :ref:`Advanced transfer mode <part-2-performance>`。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:335
msgid "Check the LMCache logs::"
msgstr "检查 LMCache 日志::"

