msgstr "[ ] 对于外部 wheel，``importlib.metadata.entry_points(group=\"lmcache.device_plugins\")`` 包含 ``foo`` 并指向 ``FooDeviceSpec``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:349
