msgstr "[ ] 如果另一个可用的后端共享 ``device_type=\"foo\"``, 请设置 ``LMCACHE_DEVICE_BACKEND=foo`` 以消除歧义。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:351
msgid ""
"[ ] Set ``DEVICE_TYPE=foo`` to force the torch-facing device category if "
