#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:362
msgid "Part 2 — Performance Optimization"
msgstr "第二部分 — 性能优化"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:364
msgid "Once basic functionality is verified, add device-specific optimizations."
msgstr "一旦基本功能得到验证，添加设备特定的优化。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:368
msgid "Device-specific ops via ``bind_native``"
msgstr "通过 ``bind_native`` 的设备特定操作"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:370
msgid ""
"The ``DeviceOps`` base class delegates every op to the torch baseline in "
"``lmcache/v1/platform/torch_ops.py``.  Each vendor may replace any subset"
" of these functions with a device-specific implementation."
msgstr "``DeviceOps`` 基类将每个操作委托给 ``lmcache/v1/platform/torch_ops.py`` 中的 torch 基线。每个供应商可以用设备特定的实现替换这些函数的任何子集。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:374
msgid ""
"**How it works.** When ``ensure_native()`` calls "
"``self.bind_native(native_module)``, the method walks the module's public"
" symbols and rebinds them as instance attributes — overriding the base-"
"class methods that delegate to ``torch_ops``:"
msgstr "**工作原理。** 当 ``ensure_native()`` 调用 ``self.bind_native(native_module)`` 时，该方法遍历模块的公共符号并将其重新绑定为实例属性——覆盖委托给 ``torch_ops`` 的基类方法："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:389
msgid "Integration contract"
msgstr "集成合同"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:391
msgid ""
"Regardless of how you build your ops module, the following contract must "
"hold:"
msgstr "无论您如何构建操作模块，以下契约必须成立："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:394
msgid ""
"**Same symbol names.** Every function you override must be exposed under "
"the exact name used in ``torch_ops.py`` (e.g. "
"``multi_layer_block_kv_transfer``)."
msgstr "**相同的符号名称。** 您重写的每个函数必须以 ``torch_ops.py`` 中使用的确切名称公开（例如 ``multi_layer_block_kv_transfer``）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:397
msgid ""
"**Same call signature.** Positional/keyword arguments, argument order and"
" semantics must match the baseline; callers invoke the ``DeviceOps`` "
"instance without knowing which backend answered."
msgstr "**相同的调用签名。** 位置参数/关键字参数、参数顺序和语义必须与基线匹配；调用者在不知道哪个后端响应的情况下调用 ``DeviceOps`` 实例。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:400
msgid ""
"**Importable Python module.** Your native module must be importable via "
"``import`` (how it gets there — a pure-Python file, a pybind11 extension,"
" a ctypes wrapper, a Rust ``PyO3`` module, etc. — is your choice)."
msgstr "**可导入的 Python 模块。** 您的本地模块必须可以通过 ``import`` 导入（如何导入——纯 Python 文件、pybind11 扩展、ctypes 包装器、Rust ``PyO3`` 模块等——由您选择）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:404
msgid ""
"**Partial override is allowed.** You do not have to reimplement every "
"function.  Anything you leave out keeps using the torch baseline, so "
"incremental optimization is supported."
msgstr "**允许部分重写。** 你不必重新实现每个函数。任何你省略的部分将继续使用 torch 基线，因此支持增量优化。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:407
msgid ""
"**Types from the native module are also bound.** ``bind_native`` also "
"binds types (classes) — this is how native plan types like "
"``StagingCopy``, ``KernelGroupSpec``, etc. overlay the stubs in "
"``ops_types.py``."
msgstr "**本地模块中的类型也被绑定。** ``bind_native`` 还绑定类型（类）——这就是本地计划类型如 ``StagingCopy``、``KernelGroupSpec`` 等如何覆盖 ``ops_types.py`` 中的存根。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:413
msgid "Implementation notes"
msgstr "实现说明"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:415
msgid ""
"``multi_layer_block_kv_transfer`` and ``lmcache_memcpy_async`` are the "
"hot entry points for both engine-driven and LMCache-driven transfer; "
"other functions in ``torch_ops.py`` can be overridden as needed."
msgstr "``multi_layer_block_kv_transfer`` 和 ``lmcache_memcpy_async`` 是引擎驱动和 LMCache 驱动传输的热点入口；``torch_ops.py`` 中的其他函数可以根据需要被重写。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:419
msgid ""
"If you fall back to the generic path from inside a device-specific "
"wrapper (e.g. when inputs are unsupported), call the corresponding "
"``lmcache.v1.platform.torch_ops`` function directly to preserve "
"semantics."
msgstr "如果您在设备特定的包装器内部（例如，当输入不受支持时）回退到通用路径，请直接调用相应的 ``lmcache.v1.platform.torch_ops`` 函数以保持语义。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:423
msgid ""
"``ensure_native()`` is called once when ``DeviceSpec.get_ops()`` first "
"creates the singleton. It is safe to fail soft (log a warning and return "
"without binding)."
msgstr "``ensure_native()`` 在 ``DeviceSpec.get_ops()`` 首次创建单例时被调用一次。失败是安全的（记录警告并返回而不绑定）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:427
msgid "For concrete reference implementations, see:"
msgstr "有关具体的参考实现，请参见："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:429
msgid ""
"``lmcache/v1/platform/cuda/device_ops.py`` — binds the compiled "
"``lmcache.cuda_ops`` pybind11 extension."
msgstr "``lmcache/v1/platform/cuda/device_ops.py`` — 绑定编译后的 ``lmcache.cuda_ops`` pybind11 扩展。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:431
msgid ""
"``lmcache/v1/platform/xpu/device_ops.py`` — binds the SYCL "
"``lmcache.xpu_ops`` extension."
msgstr "``lmcache/v1/platform/xpu/device_ops.py`` — 绑定 SYCL ``lmcache.xpu_ops`` 扩展。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:433
msgid ""
"``lmcache/v1/platform/musa/device_ops.py`` — method overrides without a "
"separate native module."
msgstr "``lmcache/v1/platform/musa/device_ops.py`` — 方法重写，无需单独的本地模块。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:437
msgid "Advanced transfer mode"
msgstr "高级传输模式"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:439
msgid ""
"By default, the transfer mode is **AUTO**: the router dispatches strictly"
" by ``device_type`` — ``device_type == \"cuda\"`` goes to "
"``LMCacheDrivenTransferContext`` (IPC zero-copy), everything else to "
"``EngineDrivenTransferContext``.  A non-CUDA device that supports IPC "
"handle transfer can still opt into LMCache-driven explicitly (below)."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，传输模式为 **AUTO**：路由器严格按照 ``device_type`` 分发 — ``device_type == "
"\\\"cuda\\\"`` 的设备使用 ``LMCacheDrivenTransferContext``（IPC 零拷贝），其他设备则使用 "
"``EngineDrivenTransferContext``。支持 IPC 句柄传输的非 CUDA 设备仍然可以显式选择 LMCache "
"驱动（如下所述）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:447
msgid ""
"Under PyTorch a ROCm GPU reports ``device_type == \"cuda\"``. LMCache "
"registers a distinct ``RocmDeviceSpec`` with ``backend_name == \"rocm\"``"
" while reusing the CUDA platform's ops, cache context, and IPC wrapper. "
"CUDA and ROCm availability checks are mutually exclusive, so AUTO mode "
"selects the correct backend without extra configuration."
msgstr "在 PyTorch 中，ROCm GPU 报告为 ``device_type == \\\"cuda\\\"``。LMCache 注册一个独特的 ``RocmDeviceSpec``，其 ``backend_name == \\\"rocm\\\"``，同时重用 CUDA 平台的操作、缓存上下文和 IPC 包装器。CUDA 和 ROCm 的可用性检查是互斥的，因此 AUTO 模式在没有额外配置的情况下选择正确的后端。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:453
msgid ""
"When the caller (or ``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE``) explicitly requests "
"``lmcache_driven``, ``_build_lmcache_driven_context`` performs two hard "
"checks — both must succeed, otherwise the factory raises ``ValueError`` "
"(no silent degradation):"
msgstr "当调用者（或 ``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE``）明确请求 ``lmcache_driven`` 时，``_build_lmcache_driven_context`` 会执行两个严格检查 — 两者必须成功，否则工厂将引发 ``ValueError``（没有静默降级）："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:458
msgid ""
"Your ``DeviceSpec`` subclass must bind a ``DeviceIPCWrapper`` subclass "
"(exposing a ``wrap`` classmethod) via "
":attr:`~lmcache.v1.platform.base.device_spec.DeviceSpec.ipc_wrapper_cls`."
" :func:`~lmcache.v1.platform.resolve_kv_wrapper_factory` reads that "
"binding off the registered spec — no separate registry / auto-scan."
msgstr "您的 ``DeviceSpec`` 子类必须通过 :attr:`~lmcache.v1.platform.base.device_spec.DeviceSpec.ipc_wrapper_cls` 绑定一个 ``DeviceIPCWrapper`` 子类（暴露一个 ``wrap`` 类方法）。 :func:`~lmcache.v1.platform.resolve_kv_wrapper_factory` 从注册的规范中读取该绑定 — 不需要单独的注册表 / 自动扫描。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:463
msgid ""
"``DeviceSpec.is_handle_transfer_available()`` must return ``True`` (the "
"base-class default; override to ``False`` only if your device lacks IPC "
"handle transfer)."
msgstr ""
"``DeviceSpec.is_handle_transfer_available()`` 必须返回 "
"``True``（基类默认值；仅当您的设备缺少 IPC 句柄传输时才重写为 ``False``）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:467
msgid ""
"Separately, the LMCache-driven server module also requires a "
"``BaseCacheContext`` subclass next to the backend (for example, "
"``lmcache/v1/platform/foo/cache_context.py`` in-tree or "
"``lmcache_foo/cache_context.py`` externally) **and** a matching "
"``DeviceSpec.create_cache_context`` override that lazy-imports and "
"instantiates it.  The platform-agnostic factory "
"``lmcache.v1.platform.cache_context.create_cache_context`` dispatches by "
"``device_type`` through the ``DeviceSpec`` registry and invokes that "
"hook; the default ``DeviceSpec.create_cache_context`` raises "
"``NotImplementedError`` so a missing override surfaces loudly instead of "
"silently falling back.  The cache context itself manages the KV cache "
"layout and pointers used for IPC transfer."
msgstr "另外，LMCache 驱动的服务器模块还需要一个位于后端旁边的 ``BaseCacheContext`` 子类（例如，树内的 ``lmcache/v1/platform/foo/cache_context.py`` 或外部的 ``lmcache_foo/cache_context.py``）**以及**一个匹配的 ``DeviceSpec.create_cache_context`` 重写，该重写延迟导入并实例化它。平台无关的工厂 ``lmcache.v1.platform.cache_context.create_cache_context`` 通过 ``DeviceSpec`` 注册表按 ``device_type`` 分发并调用该钩子；默认的 ``DeviceSpec.create_cache_context`` 会引发 ``NotImplementedError``，因此缺失的重写会显著显现，而不是静默回退。缓存上下文本身管理用于 IPC 传输的 KV 缓存布局和指针。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:480
msgid ""
"Host-side pinning via ``pin_memory_backend`` is *optional* and only "
"affects staging-buffer performance; it is not required to enable LMCache-"
"driven mode."
msgstr "通过 ``pin_memory_backend`` 在主机端固定是 *可选* 的，仅影响暂存缓冲区的性能；启用 LMCache 驱动模式并不需要它。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:485
msgid "Event IPC capability"
msgstr "事件 IPC 能力"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:487
msgid ""
"The LMCache-driven multiprocess handle path also requires a platform "
"event-IPC backend.  The capability is declared by "
"``DeviceSpec.event_ipc_backend`` and is intentionally separate from "
"``DeviceOps`` and ``DeviceIPCWrapper``:"
msgstr "LMCache 驱动的多进程句柄路径还需要一个平台事件 IPC 后端。该功能由 ``DeviceSpec.event_ipc_backend`` 声明，并故意与 ``DeviceOps`` 和 ``DeviceIPCWrapper`` 分开："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:492
msgid ""
"The base ``DeviceSpec`` returns ``None``.  A concrete device must "
"explicitly opt in."
msgstr "基础 ``DeviceSpec`` 返回 ``None``。具体设备必须明确选择加入。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:494
msgid ""
"CUDA-style event APIs can use ``DefaultEventIPCBackend(event_module=..., "
"device_type=...)``."
msgstr "CUDA 风格的事件 API 可以使用 ``DefaultEventIPCBackend(event_module=..., device_type=...)``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:496
msgid ""
"Devices with a different event ABI should implement an "
"``EventIPCBackend`` next to their in-tree or external backend."
msgstr "具有不同事件 ABI 的设备应在其内部或外部后端旁实现 ``EventIPCBackend``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:498
msgid ""
"Concrete device specs should cache the backend because request futures "
"may query this property repeatedly."
msgstr "具体设备规格应缓存后端，因为请求未来可能会重复查询此属性。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:501
msgid ""
"The backend contract covers event creation, handle export/import, event "
"recording, stream wait, query, and synchronization. "
"``check_event_support(device)`` must raise ``RuntimeError`` when those "
"operations are unavailable for the requested device.  The default backend"
" checks for a CUDA-style Event type that accepts ``interprocess=True`` "
"and provides ``from_ipc_handle``.  A custom backend should instead "
"validate the equivalent prerequisites for its own event ABI."
msgstr "后端契约涵盖事件创建、句柄导出/导入、事件记录、流等待、查询和同步。当请求的设备不支持这些操作时，``check_event_support(device)`` 必须引发 ``RuntimeError``。默认后端检查接受 ``interprocess=True`` 的 CUDA 风格事件类型，并提供 ``from_ipc_handle``。自定义后端应验证其自身事件 ABI 的等效先决条件。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:509
msgid "For a CUDA-style device, bind and cache the default backend as follows:"
msgstr "对于 CUDA 风格的设备，绑定并缓存默认后端如下："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:540
msgid ""
"Event IPC operations must preserve producer/consumer stream ordering "
"without adding a device-wide synchronization.  ``query_event`` must "
"remain non-blocking so request futures can poll completion safely."
msgstr "事件 IPC 操作必须保持生产者/消费者流的顺序，而不增加设备范围的同步。 ``query_event`` 必须保持非阻塞，以便请求未来可以安全地轮询完成情况。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:546
msgid ""
"If the device does not support Event IPC, leave the base "
"``event_ipc_backend`` implementation unchanged so it returns ``None``. "
"Engine-driven mode does not require this capability.  LMCache-driven mode"
" raises an explicit error rather than falling back to CUDA or to the "
"accelerator active in the process."
msgstr "如果设备不支持事件 IPC，请保持基础的 ``event_ipc_backend`` 实现不变，以便它返回 ``None``。引擎驱动模式不需要此功能。LMCache 驱动模式会引发显式错误，而不是回退到 CUDA 或进程中活动的加速器。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:552
msgid ""
"The capability is checked during worker/server registration and before "
"constructing a device-aware completion future.  This keeps unsupported "
"platforms from entering an asynchronous transfer path that cannot order "
"KV-cache memory safely.  The STORE and RETRIEVE message wire format is "
"unchanged: the existing event handle bytes are still carried in the "
"request and response payloads."
msgstr "该能力在工作者/服务器注册期间以及在构造设备感知的完成未来之前进行检查。这可以防止不支持的平台进入无法安全排序 KV Cache 内存的异步传输路径。STORE 和 RETRIEVE 消息的线格式保持不变：现有的事件句柄字节仍然包含在请求和响应负载中。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:559
msgid "Override these methods in your ``DeviceSpec``:"
msgstr "在你的 ``DeviceSpec`` 中重写这些方法："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:597
msgid ""
"Opt into LMCache-driven mode by setting ``lmcache.mp.mp_transfer_mode`` "
"to ``lmcache_driven`` in the vLLM ``kv_connector_extra_config`` shown in "
":ref:`Part 1 <part-1-basic>`, or by exporting "
"``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE=lmcache_driven``.  If either hard check fails,"
" the factory raises ``ValueError`` and refuses to construct the context —"
" switch back to ``engine_driven`` or ``auto``."
msgstr ""
"通过在 :ref:`Part 1 <part-1-basic>` 中显示的 vLLM ``kv_connector_extra_config`` "
"中将 ``lmcache.mp.mp_transfer_mode`` 设置为 ``lmcache_driven``，或通过导出 "
"``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE=lmcache_driven`` 来选择 LMCache "
"驱动模式。如果任何硬检查失败，工厂将引发 ``ValueError`` 并拒绝构造上下文——请切换回 ``engine_driven`` 或 "
"``auto``。"

