#~ msgid "``ops_module``"
#~ msgstr "``ops_module``"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Ops module path; leave the base-"
#~ "class default (``None``) for pure "
#~ "fallback, or override in :ref:`Part 2"
#~ " <part-2-performance>`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "操作模块路径；保留基类默认值（``None``）以实现纯回退，或在 :ref:`Part 2 "
#~ "<part-2-performance>` 中覆盖。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "That's it.  Defining this class is "
#~ "enough for auto-discovery — no "
#~ "global list or manual registration call"
#~ " is required.  All ops automatically "
#~ "route through ``lmcache.python_ops_fallback``, which"
#~ " is not performant but is "
#~ "functionally applicable to any device "
#~ "that supports the standard PyTorch "
#~ "tensor surface.  Later, each device can"
#~ " provide its own ops (Python, C, "
#~ "CUDA, Rust, or any language exposing "
#~ "Python bindings) to override the "
#~ "fallback function-by-function."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "就这样。定义这个类就足够实现自动发现——不需要全局列表或手动注册调用。所有操作自动通过 "
#~ "``lmcache.python_ops_fallback`` 路由，这虽然性能不佳，但在功能上适用于任何支持标准 "
#~ "PyTorch 张量表面的设备。之后，每个设备可以提供自己的操作（Python、C、CUDA、Rust 或任何暴露"
#~ " Python 绑定的语言）来逐个覆盖回退功能。"

#~ msgid "Start LMCache server:"
#~ msgstr "启动 LMCache 服务器："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Run vLLM with MP connector.  If "
#~ "multiple accelerators are visible on the"
#~ " host, set ``DEVICE_TYPE`` to force "
#~ "LMCache to pick the new backend "
#~ "instead of auto-detecting:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "使用 MP 连接器运行 vLLM。如果主机上可见多个加速器，请设置 "
#~ "``DEVICE_TYPE`` 强制 LMCache 选择新的后端，而不是自动检测："

#~ msgid "Check the LMCache logs — with ``ops_module = None`` you should see::"
#~ msgstr "检查 LMCache 日志 — 使用 ``ops_module = None`` 你应该看到::"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This confirms your ``DeviceSpec`` was "
#~ "discovered and the Python fallback is"
#~ " active.  (Once you set ``ops_module`` "
#~ "in :ref:`Part 2 <part-2-performance>`, the "
#~ "second line becomes ``Using backend: "
#~ "foo_device.ops`` instead.)"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这确认了您的 ``DeviceSpec`` 已被发现，并且 Python 回退处于活动状态。"
#~ " （一旦您在 :ref:`Part 2 <part-2-performance>` "
#~ "中设置了 ``ops_module``，第二行将变为 ``Using backend: "
#~ "foo_device.ops``。）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "[ ] Log shows either ``Custom ops"
#~ " not supported for device: foo, using"
#~ " fallback ops.`` (pure fallback) or "
#~ "``Using backend: foo_device.ops`` (custom ops"
#~ " loaded)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "[ ] 日志显示 ``Custom ops not "
#~ "supported for device: foo, using "
#~ "fallback ops.`` （纯回退）或 ``Using backend: "
#~ "foo_device.ops`` （加载自定义操作）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The generic ops interface is defined "
#~ "in ``lmcache/python_ops_fallback.py``.  Each vendor"
#~ " may replace any subset of these "
#~ "functions with a device-specific "
#~ "implementation; the choice of language "
#~ "(C, CUDA, SYCL, Python, Rust, …) "
#~ "and packaging is entirely up to "
#~ "the vendor.  LMCache only cares that "
#~ "the resulting symbols are importable "
#~ "from Python."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "通用操作接口在 ``lmcache/python_ops_fallback.py`` "
#~ "中定义。每个供应商可以用设备特定的实现替换这些函数的任何子集；语言的选择（C、CUDA、SYCL、Python、Rust "
#~ "等）和打包完全由供应商决定。LMCache 只关心结果符号是否可以从 Python 导入。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**How it works.** At import time, "
#~ "``get_backend(device_type)`` imports the module "
#~ "named by your ``DeviceSpec.ops_module`` and"
#~ " merges its symbols over "
#~ "``python_ops_fallback``:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**工作原理。** 在导入时，``get_backend(device_type)`` 导入由您的 "
#~ "``DeviceSpec.ops_module`` 指定的模块，并将其符号合并到 "
#~ "``python_ops_fallback`` 中："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Point ``DeviceSpec.ops_module`` at the "
#~ "module** once it is reachable on "
#~ "``sys.path``:"
#~ msgstr "**将 ``DeviceSpec.ops_module`` 指向模块** 一旦它可以在 ``sys.path`` 上访问："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keep your ops module free of side"
#~ " effects at import time — it is"
#~ " imported eagerly during ``get_backend()``."
#~ msgstr "在导入时保持你的 ops 模块没有副作用——它在 ``get_backend()`` 中被急切导入。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "For concrete reference implementations, see"
